                                "sense_id": "5e2149da-0b16-3a2d-8aa5-5e073babce48",
                                "text": "De technicus zal de metalen legeren om een sterker en duurzamer materiaal te creëren.",
                                "translation": "The technician will alloy the metals to create a stronger and more durable material.",
                                "english": "The technician will alloy the metals to create a stronger and more durable material."
